{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20260906/photo/bkn-20260906165545344-0906_00992_001_01p.jpg?20260906170338\"/><p>穆罕默德應邀訪問中國。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>中國外交部發言人周日（6日）宣布，卡塔爾首相兼外交大臣穆罕默德將於周一至周二（7至8日）應邀訪問中國。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T09:18:14.790320+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none"}}